            <div xml:id="m-0ea5083f-059a-424b-a60b-eaa8a613147f">
              <lg xml:id="m-fc59b977-4067-4a09-90ad-f9a9965450ea">
                <l xml:id="m-48455404-5ba2-42b1-b4c3-934ad01a72f1" facs="#m-ef3178d4-81e3-400b-b8bc-0f360813ac91" label="ambiguous">822</l><l xml:id="m-dfb1d1d7-447f-4ec0-95ea-35898ffb7f9b" facs="#m-2c5a050e-82df-474f-a770-3838affe6392" label="text-like">ard Sunday aiter Easter.</l><l xml:id="m-2706e50d-ec70-4466-98bb-038ba13051b2" facs="#m-e1757a30-3f77-43f6-93ed-a98e7cc813f0" label="ambiguous">Collect.</l><l xml:id="m-156d307f-aa03-4258-a5db-24626736a577" facs="#m-46a09264-6ebe-4250-8a0e-3cf946f29b1f" label="lyrics-like">Eus, qui errántibus, ut in viam¡ séntur, et illa respúere quae huic</l><l xml:id="m-60d16bd4-9579-4fc0-8ae2-e82c7202de0e" facs="#m-a1d14b99-6e6a-426f-b748-675f76c039c5" label="lyrics-like">A possint redire justitiae, veritá-linimíca sunt nómini; * et ea quae</l><l xml:id="m-312d1727-8e6d-4fd4-bde7-2033ae63e02c" facs="#m-de507a9b-3385-4391-8809-efb5f2feb7ec" label="lyrics-like">tis tuae lumen osténdis: t da cun-] sunt apta sectári. Per Dóminum.</l><l xml:id="m-26418fa2-d072-4288-a0cf-fd248483dc9a" facs="#m-717ecbc1-ca97-461a-83e5-b5c9f31ff077" label="lyrics-like">ctis qui christiána professióne cen¬</l><l xml:id="m-bf99b73f-49cf-4290-ac32-fe90754ccc1e" facs="#m-4ccefd1e-12cf-47c0-bb5b-e85be00c614b" label="text-like">2. of Our Lady, p. 817. — 3. for the Church or for the Pope, p. 319.</l><l xml:id="m-22261ed3-758a-4e36-a05c-ef7c1e25d3f9" facs="#m-f91eac1e-23ce-4e29-bf9e-8493cd11c337" label="ambiguous">Lectio Epistolae beati Petri Apostoli. 1. Petr. 2. b.</l><l xml:id="m-fd50fc01-6d78-4573-a2e5-d3cddc3e71e4" facs="#m-e5cd2436-4272-495d-8025-d17a413c73df" label="lyrics-like">(VArissimi : Obsecro vos tamquam! dem vero bonórum: quia sic est</l><l xml:id="m-823a6119-20a7-4d0f-be77-aba6e0ebae59" facs="#m-2c45fe51-5758-451c-8ae0-c7f638d4924e" label="lyrics-like">volúntas Dei, ut benefaciéntes ob¬</l><l xml:id="m-01d0462e-759f-4a45-8011-139c4878907e" facs="#m-54b18f2e-b541-4c42-8c67-dfebf70603cd" label="lyrics-like">ádvenas et peregrinos abstinére</l><l xml:id="m-3ee3d635-6ab2-47a0-848d-bab880a1bb40" facs="#m-8ca69ad5-d26c-4f6e-bd36-c703ab022c03" label="lyrics-like">vos a carnálibus desidériis, quae</l><l xml:id="m-e7c6086c-5b4e-408d-b4d5-38e962eec2fd" facs="#m-9b5006c5-ba65-468c-b6d8-86bbf7e890ad" label="lyrics-like">mutéscere faciátis imprudéntium</l><l xml:id="m-2718afbc-5270-48da-a096-2247c02203cc" facs="#m-232a1e81-086e-49f4-bd2f-9a0529310d07" label="lyrics-like">militant advérsus ánimam, conver¬</l><l xml:id="m-c66e32c0-ea48-424c-8a8d-4a9ed4cba5f9" facs="#m-98d9f832-c7c6-496d-a73f-3ddf607515f8" label="lyrics-like">hóminum ignorántiam: quasi liberi,</l><l xml:id="m-2ab9bb10-fb16-4bd6-9f2e-a01e228f0548" facs="#m-cbdaceec-a09e-438f-beb2-8c8af46706f3" label="lyrics-like">satiónem vestram inter Gentes ha¬</l><l xml:id="m-28044714-2c6f-4ac2-8c74-fc11a551c39f" facs="#m-d893c06d-7df1-4ce7-b23d-3e1e22007c45" label="lyrics-like">et non quasi velámen habéntes ma¬</l><l xml:id="m-09980c62-33f0-4bfa-9184-c9cc2238b989" facs="#m-737dd2cc-1ed7-4c28-abbc-7305bbf51758" label="lyrics-like">litiae libertátem, sed sicut servi</l><l xml:id="m-501a3987-ed17-47a4-99d6-c5b752efab43" facs="#m-919f52c6-001d-4142-a3ed-79bf8fc0a2d3" label="lyrics-like">béntes bonam : ut in eo. quod de¬</l><l xml:id="m-08f09a34-a01c-4952-85a8-de6f65e9cd48" facs="#m-b4af671f-cb18-441d-a641-c9e6f99d7de0" label="lyrics-like">Dei. Omnes honorâte: fraternitá¬</l><l xml:id="m-97953890-e4e8-41c1-aa90-a3c44409310f" facs="#m-ef57741a-d6cb-496d-977e-aee91ad7ec65" label="lyrics-like">tréctant de vobis tamquam de ma¬</l><l xml:id="m-16efb55c-76d6-4bf9-a6bf-205b4e4b59e1" facs="#m-0a7369ec-2cbe-43bc-b69c-7f1ed516bfbf" label="lyrics-like">tem diligite: Deum timéte: regem</l><l xml:id="m-ae90e6f7-4822-434f-b3fe-2b854b97610c" facs="#m-70d78480-4d43-4eb8-a1f3-a926cf54a945" label="lyrics-like">lefactóribus, ex bonis opéribus vos</l><l xml:id="m-a1252199-56de-4f3e-9e71-87a32bd590fa" facs="#m-239f40ce-6660-4f71-bcf9-8220cfa1660b" label="lyrics-like">considerántes, glorificent Deum in</l><l xml:id="m-06c69563-4cad-4334-bd2e-82d4dbc20d94" facs="#m-8ba246c6-7102-43dd-a84d-f6526e3dfe05" label="lyrics-like">honorificate. Servi, súbditi estóte in</l><l xml:id="m-b7c3b12e-505d-4d5c-aa82-58c3dd9a215f" facs="#m-9e827074-44b1-4908-929f-d78823a7d902" label="lyrics-like">die visitatiónis. Subiécti igitur estó¬</l><l xml:id="m-b16fee6c-f2d7-4a3d-b42e-776fbf1c711c" facs="#m-839bdddc-df53-419e-9be0-723191979675" label="lyrics-like">omni timóre dóminis, non tantum</l><l xml:id="m-0ba1a59d-86d7-4312-8262-36ac84a9bb7b" facs="#m-a7e20681-0f79-4ee8-a653-ef3f29b1760b" label="lyrics-like">bonis et modéstis, sed étiam dysco¬</l><l xml:id="m-1fab45c4-b2bc-42a8-8108-63e326c12c47" facs="#m-bbc2fd64-6fb1-4b7f-8e27-0850b37c69d0" label="lyrics-like">te omni humánae creatúrae propter</l><l xml:id="m-a722298a-3b78-471c-b6d9-6d12f2a59e60" facs="#m-ed65a979-42bd-499e-b129-81875f3d63d7" label="lyrics-like">lis. Haec est enim grátia : in Chri¬</l><l xml:id="m-4a2bc446-d355-4db8-b617-ab7558405a69" facs="#m-97c60f31-5cc8-4e10-a75f-51ed423a20f4" label="lyrics-like">Deum: sive regi quasi praecellénti:</l><l xml:id="m-aa703acb-01f2-4c2a-ba8f-02d98e80d329" facs="#m-ab9ea9a1-82ac-4e2a-95ba-fca3bf3191eb" label="lyrics-like">sto Jesu Dómino nostro.</l><l xml:id="m-6ffc42d7-a386-49f3-8e40-dc1eca30c9ee" facs="#m-1cb6cf70-eb06-445f-ae3f-93f7f692695a" label="lyrics-like">sive dúcibus tamquam ab eo missis</l><l xml:id="m-f75028f8-a9ce-4deb-9f7c-2b8740cfb76b" facs="#m-7dbcbdd4-1826-4a9d-aee0-54e56836e255" label="lyrics-like">ad vindictam malefactórum, lau¬</l><l xml:id="m-02cb03e6-3497-43b1-ae30-05ec2dd1e584" facs="#m-370a5016-4e6f-453d-bc9e-980392d31d0f" label="ambiguous">2.</l><l xml:id="m-22c1a459-9816-4a6f-84ba-a5b8b0bca8d6" facs="#m-3dd64cf9-7c2b-4f71-9a24-482c75264e62" label="ambiguous">H</l><l xml:id="m-246c82bf-9397-4c8d-908d-bc05e2da87d9" facs="#m-62e83e5f-fb9e-4454-848a-7228875444ea" label="ambiguous">V. Redempti¬</l><l xml:id="m-f84cc1ce-9c85-4af8-aef6-38f911cdf95a" facs="#m-de8dba73-5d0d-4efe-9113-21124420c76c" label="ambiguous">ij</l><l xml:id="m-c9031d8d-9638-4224-b8f3-6071f449763d" facs="#m-21ba0bff-6ddb-4392-9f3d-97267c9546eb" label="lyrics-like">L-lelú-ia.</l><l xml:id="m-0e1ef270-8656-4533-b10f-12b576d17aef" facs="#m-e1396305-a121-436d-b20e-c751151b1a3e" label="lyrics-like">in pópulo</l><l xml:id="m-72f84556-dca6-4dde-a248-5a7a13b3952c" facs="#m-4ae18cc5-f054-4cb9-984d-563112349d39" label="lyrics-like">6́¬</l><l xml:id="m-2d91e451-2abe-4a32-a382-dbe958742f81" facs="#m-86d874dd-3767-4773-95a5-122a63ee8510" label="lyrics-like">nem mí¬ sit Dó¬</l><l xml:id="m-8caea552-4725-4a4f-94f6-4ee857c34841" facs="#m-6d81c816-fd54-42a2-ab27-6946cd084adc" label="ambiguous">mi-nus</l><l xml:id="m-e1fd2463-4533-4260-ba3b-2054df0dcd90" facs="#m-21839ef7-5d29-4142-91a7-c383b91dde58" label="lyrics-like">sú-o.</l><l xml:id="m-1f1a175a-c1bd-47d1-853e-ec9161a9786a" facs="#m-ef63c1f9-a526-43dd-a48b-fb74046e9a7d" label="ambiguous">4.</l><l xml:id="m-f77f5cf8-3dd6-4ece-8ab4-47f7f3e69fbd" facs="#m-fd383141-d487-42c9-b454-67a3cf462448" label="ambiguous">H</l><l xml:id="m-a4e25ae9-4fb5-476c-b748-8dbd2ab24a6b" facs="#m-cef42074-b299-4b05-b3fb-1ee8b2bdbef1" label="lyrics-like">lú-ia.</l><l xml:id="m-0ce8ef0c-7d40-46c6-906d-b4e1f9df11b6" facs="#m-2ae01ce5-e9da-4c7d-9772-31acf5d9f0b9" label="ambiguous">L-le¬</l><l xml:id="m-981d2955-6299-400a-afa8-1a00eb6fd250" facs="#m-5c50805a-a0fe-4f07-8145-e4bd7877ea98" label="ambiguous">V. Opor¬</l><l xml:id="m-7ac223fe-f075-4c16-a0d7-78c2394ad16e" facs="#m-27f7a7f3-77c5-45cb-871e-0035d377aa4c" label="lyrics-like">té- bat</l><l xml:id="m-43008309-dd07-4a88-987c-7525457f0c17" facs="#m-6585f89e-cfd2-4010-8655-869b0bd9908e" label="lyrics-like">pá¬</l><l xml:id="m-7e5fc85d-a84a-41ba-9d05-65246fe29741" facs="#m-0eef7248-4f3d-4d69-927f-0f83e1c67b33" label="lyrics-like">ti Chrí-stum, et re-súrge-re</l><l xml:id="m-8042cbe0-233b-4b0d-be6f-b8076f5e0c26" facs="#m-bd1f09f1-eae9-4826-8785-d46e518aee10" label="lyrics-like">a mór¬</l></lg>
